  "title": "Jason Arday mural at Notting Hill Carnival",
  "summary": "A mural commemorating late Cambridge professor Jason Arday is displayed at London’s Notting Hill Carnival, highlighting his contributions to the event's history as a form of resistance against racism. Meanwhile, the Notting Hill Carnival continues to draw millions to west London.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Jason Arday was a Cambridge professor and a key figure in the Notting Hill Carnival's history as a protest against racism.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The mural commemorates his legacy and is displayed at the event to honor his contributions to the community.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The event has grown from a form of resistance to a celebration of culture and identity in west London.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
